# imrahil-dispatches.log — outgoing, Prince of Dol Amroth to his household
# filed: Tirith Aear, the sea-ward tower · cross-refs: swan-knights-roster.csv

3019-03-09 17:00:00 INFO  arrived Minas Tirith; ours the last and largest of the southern fiefs
3019-03-09 17:05:00 INFO  city cheered; a halfling on the wall cheered loudest
3019-03-10 09:00:00 WARN  no dawn today; some darkness out of the east. harbour watch: stay on the walls
3019-03-13 18:00:00 WARN  Osgiliath lost; we ride out to bring the rearguard in
3019-03-13 19:30:00 INFO  Faramir brought back on a bier; wounded, not dead
3019-03-15 06:00:00 INFO  Rohan arrived with the morning; we sortie from the gate
3019-03-15 12:30:00 INFO  found the shieldmaiden of Rohan among the fallen; she breathes. sent to the Houses
3019-03-15 13:00:00 WARN  black sails on the river. then the King's standard on them. all is well
3019-03-15 22:00:00 INFO  the Lord Aragorn asks me to hold the city; I hold it
3019-03-16 10:00:00 INFO  the Elf Legolas bowed and said he saw the old blood in us. I did not argue
3019-03-18 08:00:00 INFO  marching to the Black Gate with the Captains of the West. do not wait up
3019-03-25 15:00:00 INFO  the Tower is fallen. we are alive. tell the gulls
3019-05-01 12:00:00 INFO  the King is crowned. coming home by the sea road
